  "text": "## Frequently Asked Questions  \n**Q: When will I earn interest?**\nA: Your first interest payment will be at the end of the month following your opening. After that, monthly on the last business day.  \n**Q: Can I withdraw my money anytime?**\nA: Yes, completely. No waiting periods, no penalties. SmartSaver is fully accessible.  \n**Q: How do I change my rate?**\nA: You can't (it's variable), but you'll always be competitive. We guarantee a fixed 2.5% margin above the Bank of England rate.  \n**Q: Is my money safe?**\nA: Completely. We're regulated by the FCA and PRA, and your deposits are protected by FSCS (up to £85,000).  \n**Q: How do I reset my password?**\nA: Log in to online banking, click \"Forgot Password,\" and follow the link sent to your email.  \n**Q: Can I set up standing orders?**\nA: Yes, once your account is open, log in and select \"Payments\" to set up recurring transfers.  \n**Q: What if I lose my card?**\nA: Call 0800-555-2265 immediately. We'll block it and send a replacement (3–5 days free, or overnight for £25).  \n**Q: Can I open a joint account?**\nA: Yes! Both account holders have equal access and withdrawal rights. Contact us for details.  \n---",
